{
  "core_message": "All 155 passengers survived because the pilots chose to glide into the Hudson River instead of attempting an emergency landing elsewhere.",
  "mood": "curious",
  "title": "155 survivors: How a bird strike forced a Hudson glide",
  "description": "When a flock of geese struck a US Airways A320, the pilots faced a split‑second decision.\nThey chose to glide into the Hudson River, turning what could have been a tragedy into a remarkable survival.\n\nKey facts\n• 155 aboard, 0 fatalities\n• Decision made in under four minutes\n• Hudson River landing was the safest option\n• The incident earned the nickname “Miracle on the Hudson.”\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"US Airways Flight 1549\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/US_Airways_Flight_1549), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.\n\nImages from Wikimedia Commons:\nFlight 1549-OptionsNotTaken.PNG (ChrisnHouston, GFDL): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flight_1549-OptionsNotTaken.PNG\nUS Airways Flight 1549 in Hudson cropped.JPG (Izno , cropped by Falcorian, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Airways_Flight_1549_in_Hudson_cropped.JPG\nUS Air Flight 1549 rescue efforts.jpg (Photo by Chris Gardner, USACE New York District Public Affairs, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Air_Flight_1549_rescue_efforts.jpg\nUSAirways-1549 lifting out of Hudson.jpg (Spyropk, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USAirways-1549_lifting_out_of_Hudson.jpg\nUSAir 1549 bird feather.jpg (National Transportation Safety Board, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USAir_1549_bird_feather.jpg\nParkingLotMotherCanadaGoose (cropped).jpg (PumpkinSky, CC BY-SA 3.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ParkingLotMotherCanadaGoose_(cropped).jpg\nFlight1549BatteryPark2 crop.jpg (U.S. Coast Guard photo / PA3 Barbara L. Patton, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flight1549BatteryPark2_crop.jpg\nAviacionavion.png (Turkmenistan.airlines.frontview.arp.jpg : elfuser derivative work: Elfuser ( tal, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aviacionavion.png",
